# Vendored libs build in-source (esp. FFmpeg: config.h, libav*/, binaries).
# Ignore everything two levels deep, but keep the thin per-lib ExternalProject
# glue (CMakeLists + meson/cmake/patch helpers) tracked so a clean clone builds.
# The top-level thirdparty/README.md (one level) is unaffected.
thirdparty/*/*
!thirdparty/*/CMakeLists.txt
!thirdparty/*/*.cmake
!thirdparty/*/*.ini
!thirdparty/*/*.patch

# Python bytecode (build.py importa o bootstrap.py)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
/QtExamples/
